{"id":"house_az_6_joanna-mendoza","n":"JoAnna Mendoza","p":"Democratic","race":{"mode":"house","st":"AZ","d":"6","city":null},"updated":"2026-11-09","bio":"JoAnna H. Mendoza (born 1975 or 1976) is an American politician and military veteran who is the U.S. representative-elect for Arizona's 6th congressional district. A member of the Democratic Party, Mendoza beat incumbent Republican Juan Ciscomani in the 2026 election.","bioSrc":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoAnna_Mendoza","wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoAnna_Mendoza","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/CLR-17_conducts_morning_training_in_remembrance_of_9_11_%28Image_3_of_5%29.jpg/330px-CLR-17_conducts_morning_training_in_remembrance_of_9_11_%28Image_3_of_5%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imgSrc":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:CLR-17_conducts_morning_training_in_remembrance_of_9_11_(Image_3_of_5).jpg","qid":"Q141993947"}